Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 1843
Function: libxml_xmlFreeValidCtxt
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: PyValidCtxt_Get(pyobj_cur) can return NULL, but the code immediately reads cur->userData. Passing an invalid/closed validator context will crash due to a NULL pointer dereference.

